{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》踏入第13集迎來高潮，李德龍（馬國明飾）在藍鳳儀（姚子羚飾）生日宴上借醉發難，當眾向大 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》踏入第13集迎來高潮，李德龍（馬國明飾）在藍鳳儀（姚子羚飾）生日宴上借醉發難，當眾向大哥陳雲生（陳豪飾）狠潑紅酒宣洩不滿。這場突如其來的激烈衝突不僅令全場震驚，更直接打亂了莊寶兒（陳星妤飾）原本準備進行的秘密行動。這場看似衝動的鬧劇背後，實則隱藏著精心佈局的權謀算計。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚生日宴會馬國明發難潑酒</h2>\n<p>在11月播出的《玫瑰戰爭》第13集劇情中，藍鳳儀舉辦盛大生日宴會，莊寶兒原定帶同母親關子盈（陳自瑤飾）遺留下來項鍊向天誠娛樂老闆陳雲生相認。李德龍為阻止這場時機尚未成熟認親行動，暗中聯同夏無雙（楊茜堯飾）展開秘密部署。當晚李德龍先將莊寶兒反鎖在洗手間內限制其行動，隨後趁機在宴會大廳假裝喝醉，徑直走到陳雲生面前狠潑紅酒，並當眾大聲控訴對方多年來種種打壓，激烈舉動瞬間令現場氣氛降至冰點。</p>\n<h2>陳豪無奈離場陳星妤錯失認親良機</h2>\n<p>面對親弟弟李德龍當眾潑酒挑釁與嚴厲控訴，身為娛樂公司老闆陳雲生處於極度尷尬境地，最終只能選擇提早離開宴會現場以平息風波。陳雲生這次無奈離場，恰好讓剛從洗手間脫困莊寶兒撲了個空，徹底錯失向疑似親生父親坦白身世絕佳機會。夏無雙與李德龍聯手策劃這場阻截行動雖然取得初步成功，卻也令陳雲生與莊寶兒雙方再度擦身而過，讓這段錯綜複雜血緣關係繼續被掩蓋在重重迷霧之中。</p>\n<h2>馬國明陳豪因陳自瑤結下七年恩怨</h2>\n<p>劇中李德龍與陳雲生這對親兄弟關係決裂並非一朝一夕，兩人早在七年前便因為同時愛上影后關子盈而產生無法修補裂痕。隨著關子盈後來疑遭資本勢力脅迫致死，兩兄弟之間矛盾日益加深，近年陳雲生更在事業發展及電影《玫瑰》拍攝安排上處處針對並打壓李德龍。這次宴會上潑酒事件表面上是為了阻止莊寶兒認親而故意製造混亂，實際上亦是李德龍將積壓長達七年新仇舊恨一次過爆發出來。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議演員演技激讚衝突感十足</h2>\n<p>隨著這場充滿張力潑酒戲碼播出，隨即在各大社交平台引發大量觀眾熱烈討論。不少網民對於視帝同台飆戲感到相當震撼，紛紛留言表示「馬國明發酒癲演得好逼真」、「陳豪被潑酒嗰下個反應好有氣場」。部分觀眾則對劇情走向表現出極高期待，直指「娛樂圈明爭暗鬥最好睇」，更有網民留言指出「楊茜堯同馬國明夾計真係好狠」，高度關注主角團後續復仇計劃將如何進一步展開。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559735453751137_3629448496b06a42b28c06.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Crisp, subtitle-free TV still-7.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559735453751137_3629448496b06a42b28c06.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李德龍（馬國明飾）在藍鳳儀的生日宴上假扮醉酒。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559736316054731_17312547736b06a433eab2e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Crisp restored TV still-4.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559736316054731_17312547736b06a433eab2e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955973724179418_5892495946b06a43cdd766.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-39’55”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955973724179418_5892495946b06a43cdd766.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳雲生（陳豪飾）遭親弟弟當眾潑酒，面對一眾賓客尷尬不已。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559737349689918_17770705606b06a43de8b36.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-34’39”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559737349689918_17770705606b06a43de8b36.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>莊寶兒（陳星妤飾）帶着亡母關子盈留下的項鍊赴宴，想向陳雲生問清自己的身世。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559737436350704_21385523056b06a43ead357.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-34’59”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559737436350704_21385523056b06a43ead357.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>莊寶兒原定在生日宴上認親，卻被李德龍反鎖在洗手間。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%98%9f%e5%a6%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳星妤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%ac%e5%9c%8b%e6%98%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">馬國明</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549996\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.920215+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1466,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:37:48.332894+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:28.866562+00:00","content_hash":"8c0c1ccb4d976e5ece4f6b55613871cafa35aa473c8bbfa90b34ae06a117af68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}